sequenceDiagram
    actor Teacher
    actor Student
    participant TUI as Teacher Gradebook
    participant API as Teacher API
    participant Service as Teacher Service
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant SUI as Student Grades Page

    Teacher->>TUI: Create component and enter grades
    TUI->>API: POST /teacher/grades/component
    API->>Service: Persist grade component
    Service->>DB: Insert component metadata
    DB-->>Service: Component saved
    API-->>TUI: Component created

    Teacher->>TUI: Submit student scores
    TUI->>API: POST /teacher/grades/records
    API->>Service: Validate scores and weights
    Service->>DB: Upsert grade records
    DB-->>Service: Scores stored
    API-->>TUI: Draft grades saved

    Teacher->>TUI: Publish final grades
    TUI->>API: POST /teacher/grades/publish
    API->>Service: Aggregate records and finalize result
    Service->>DB: Upsert final grades and notifications
    DB-->>Service: Final grades committed
    API-->>TUI: Publication success

    Student->>SUI: Open grades page
    SUI->>API: GET /students/me/grades
    API->>DB: Load final grades
    DB-->>API: Published results
    API-->>SUI: Grade payload
    SUI-->>Student: View final grade summary
